    "Deepen is applied to each complete phaseB candidate whose canonical score is below the band, with the proposals left of the 16 of the whole sample: repeated best-of-pool steps of the native bounded objective in a seeded order (fork deepen) until the band minimum is reached or no admissible proposal remains; the final committed puzzle is rated once",
